# Repository safety

- Work only inside this repository.
- Do not read or modify paths outside the project root.
- Do not read secrets unless the user explicitly asks.
- Do not modify `.env` unless the user explicitly asks.
- Do not run destructive commands without explicit approval.
- Do not run `docker system prune`.
- Do not delete Docker volumes without explicit approval.
- Do not start containers with `--privileged`.
- Do not mount `/`, `/home`, `/etc`, or other sensitive host paths.
